@host = http://localhost:5080

### 1) No message -> agent greeting (starts a new conversation)
POST {{host}}/api/chat

### 1b) Same thing with an explicit null message
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": null }

### 2) Ask something, continuing the conversation (paste the conversationId returned above)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What can you help me with?",
  "conversationId": "<conversationId from the previous response>"
}

### ---------------- Voice with the agent (PCM16, 24 kHz, mono) ----------------
# The audio is transcribed (Speech:TranscriptionDeployment), answered by the agent exactly like a typed
# message (same conversation, same tools such as web search) and read aloud (Speech:SpeechDeployment).
# Response body is audio/wav (save it to listen). The conversation id comes back in the
# X-Conversation-Id header and the agent's words in X-Agent-Transcript (URL-encoded).
# Convert any recording with: ffmpeg -i input.m4a -ar 24000 -ac 1 -c:a pcm_s16le question.wav

### 3) Empty body -> agent's spoken greeting (starts a new conversation)
POST {{host}}/api/chat/audio

### 4) Send a spoken question, continuing a conversation (text or audio one)
POST {{host}}/api/chat/audio?conversationId=<conversationId>
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./question.wav

### 5) Raw PCM in and out
POST {{host}}/api/chat/audio?format=pcm&conversationId=<conversationId>
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< ./question.pcm

### 6) JSON out (what the React app uses): { conversationId, transcript, wav (base64) }
POST {{host}}/api/chat/audio?format=json&conversationId=<conversationId>
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./question.wav

### ---------------- TEST ONLY: realtime model, NO agent ----------------
# VoiceLive realtime model (VoiceLive:RealtimeModel, default gpt-realtime). The Foundry agent is NOT used:
# no agent instructions, no web search, no conversation (conversationId is not accepted).
# The model's words come back in X-Model-Transcript; X-Voice-Target says "agent=none".
# Only available when ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development (404 otherwise).

### 7) Realtime model greeting
POST {{host}}/api/chat/audio/realtime

### 8) Realtime model answer to a spoken question
POST {{host}}/api/chat/audio/realtime
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./question.wav
